844 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Who Should Attend Digital Dealer\077\n\nDigital Dealer is built for dealership professionals and automotive solution providers looking to improve performance\054 discover new strategies\054 and connect with industry leaders\056\n\nDealership Professionals\n\nLeadership and Management Teams\nMarketing and Customer Acquisition Professionals\neCommerce\054 Digital Retail\054 and CRM Teams\nSales\054 Service\054 and Operations Leaders\nTechnology and Solution Providers\n\nMeet dealership decision\055makers seeking solutions in\072\n\nMarketing and Advertising\nAI and Data Technology\nDigital Retail and eCommerce\nCRM and Customer Experience\nFixed Ops and Service Solutions\nSales and Performance Management)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 845 0 R
     /Pg 832 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
