852 0 obj
  << /ActualText (About Digital Dealer 2026\n\nGrow Dealership Performance at Digital Dealer 2026\n\nDigital Dealer 2026 is the leading event for automotive retail professionals looking to improve dealership performance through proven strategies\054 industry partnerships\054 and innovative technology\056 The event brings together dealership leaders\054 marketing teams\054 eCommerce professionals\054 and solution providers for two days of education\054 networking\054 and hands\055on learning\056\n\nExperience Live Demos and Industry Networking\n\nThe expo floor offers hands\055on access to the latest automotive retail technology\056 Watch live product demonstrations\054 speak directly with industry experts\054 and connect with partners who can help improve dealership performance\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 851 0 R
     /Pg 832 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

